sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant Browser as 🖥️ Browser
    participant Frontend as React Frontend
    participant tRPC as tRPC API
    participant Backend as Express Backend
    participant Domain as Domain Logic
    participant LLM as 🤖 LLM Service
    participant Database as 💾 Database

    User->>Browser: Opens Health Dashboard
    Browser->>Frontend: Loads React App
    Frontend->>tRPC: Fetch User Exams
    tRPC->>Backend: Route to Handler
    Backend->>Database: Query Exams
    Database-->>Backend: Return Exam Data
    Backend-->>tRPC: Return Type-Safe Data
    tRPC-->>Frontend: Hydrate State
    Frontend->>Browser: Render Exam List

    User->>Browser: Select 3 Exams for Analysis
    Browser->>Frontend: Trigger Analysis
    Frontend->>tRPC: Call analyzeExams(ids)
    tRPC->>Backend: Route to Analysis Handler
    Backend->>Domain: Process Correlations
    Domain->>Database: Fetch Related Data
    Database-->>Domain: Return Complete Data
    Domain->>LLM: Generate Medical Report
    LLM-->>Domain: Return AI Analysis
    Domain-->>Backend: Formatted Report
    Backend-->>tRPC: Type-Safe Response
    tRPC-->>Frontend: Analysis Result
    Frontend->>Browser: Display Report + Recommendations

    User->>Browser: Save Report
    Browser->>Frontend: Persist Action
    Frontend->>tRPC: Save Report
    tRPC->>Backend: Store in Database
    Backend->>Database: Insert Report
    Database-->>Backend: Confirmation
    Backend-->>tRPC: Success Response
    tRPC-->>Frontend: UI Update
    Frontend->>Browser: Show Success Message
